WEBVTT

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

01:47.840 --> 01:51.840
We vampires have a noble existence,

01:51.840 --> 01:54.620
but we are not complete.

01:55.410 --> 01:59.850
If I drink the blood of royalty,
I will become complete.

01:59.850 --> 02:03.690
I will become the supreme vampire,
who's superseded death itself.

02:13.900 --> 02:15.530
Huga.

02:16.260 --> 02:19.910
Oh, right, I met with my older brother, Emile.

02:23.610 --> 02:29.680
It seems he's thinking things through
before he begins to fight me in earnest.

02:30.680 --> 02:33.160
A fight for the throne, huh?

02:34.220 --> 02:36.980
I don't have any interest in the throne, however.

02:36.990 --> 02:37.990
Huga.

02:37.990 --> 02:39.390
I know.

02:39.390 --> 02:43.360
The fight is only going to intensify
from here on out.

02:43.830 --> 02:45.960
Our battle forces are small.

02:45.960 --> 02:50.970
I've got one soldier whom I've granted
my Flame to, but he's unreliable.

02:52.330 --> 02:54.000
Where's Hiro?

02:54.000 --> 02:55.440
Huga.

02:55.440 --> 02:57.250
He's at Sherwood's?

03:00.380 --> 03:01.580
Though she has Francesca
to help with the housework?

03:04.510 --> 03:05.550
Huga.

03:05.550 --> 03:10.550
I know, that younger sister of mine was just
looking for an excuse to call him over.

03:11.220 --> 03:15.030
I don't mind. She can have him
as much as she wants for now.

03:17.090 --> 03:19.900
I finished all the work, Princess Sherwood.

03:23.000 --> 03:25.430
Good work, Hiro, Ryu-Ryu.

03:25.430 --> 03:27.410
You can take the rest of the night off.

03:30.270 --> 03:31.340
Huga.

03:31.340 --> 03:33.940
Thank you, Francesca.

03:33.940 --> 03:37.680
Hiro, you said she met with
our brother Emile, huh?

03:37.680 --> 03:41.550
Yes, what's Emile like?

03:41.550 --> 03:42.880
I don't know.

03:42.880 --> 03:44.550
You don't?

03:44.550 --> 03:49.550
I don't. He's my brother,
but we don't live together.

03:49.990 --> 03:53.130
I even have some siblings I've never really met.

03:53.700 --> 03:55.330
Really?

03:56.000 --> 03:59.470
We're royalty. We're different
from your average family.

03:59.970 --> 04:04.970
But my older brother Emile
was very kind to me as a child.

04:05.940 --> 04:08.320
At least, I think he was.

04:10.680 --> 04:15.480
But you're going to have to
fight him someday, huh?

04:15.480 --> 04:19.090
'Tis the fate of those born of the King's loins.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.020
Well, see you later.

04:24.030 --> 04:26.290
Say hi to my sister for me.

04:26.290 --> 04:28.270
Oh, that's right, Hiro.

04:28.630 --> 04:32.830
It's not just my sister and me.
You need to be careful, too.

04:32.830 --> 04:34.310
Huh? I should?

04:34.500 --> 04:37.540
As I said before, though we're siblings,

04:37.540 --> 04:40.980
I cannot say at all what
some of them may be plotting.

04:40.980 --> 04:44.350
Plus, you're a soldier in the Royal Guard now.

04:44.350 --> 04:47.520
Don't ever forget that you're
caught up in this fight, too.

04:47.520 --> 04:48.850
Huga.

04:48.850 --> 04:50.830
I'll be careful.

05:03.200 --> 05:07.410
I'm feeling all oddly tense now because
Princess Sherwood said that to me.

05:11.940 --> 05:13.570
Hey!

05:13.580 --> 05:15.040
Liza!

05:15.040 --> 05:16.840
You're going back to the mansion, right?

05:16.850 --> 05:18.350
I'll give you a lift.

05:18.350 --> 05:20.160
Great, thanks.

05:25.020 --> 05:28.290
Something strange...

05:28.290 --> 05:30.100
...is coming!

05:33.530 --> 05:35.170
Bats?

05:36.900 --> 05:40.370
What? Is it Reiri? Or Zeppeli?

05:40.640 --> 05:43.620
I'm afraid I am neither.

05:47.980 --> 05:49.790
A vampire?

05:50.150 --> 05:52.480
My name is Dracul.

05:52.480 --> 05:54.150
Dracul?

05:54.150 --> 05:56.390
What did a vampire come here for?

05:56.920 --> 06:00.620
A werewolf? I have no business with a dog.

06:00.620 --> 06:02.290
I'm not a dog!

06:02.290 --> 06:05.100
I came for you.

06:06.160 --> 06:09.830
You, the soldier of the royal princess.

06:09.830 --> 06:13.570
Now, will you come with me?

06:13.570 --> 06:15.670
I don't know what you're up to,

06:15.670 --> 06:18.910
but he's not just going to say, "Sure, why not."

06:18.910 --> 06:20.910
Hmph. A dog!

06:21.140 --> 06:24.990
I told you not to... call me a dog!

06:25.250 --> 06:28.060
A little girl cannot defeat me!

06:28.650 --> 06:30.460
Damn you...

06:31.750 --> 06:34.630
Dogs are meant to be chained up.

06:36.160 --> 06:37.190
Liza!

06:37.190 --> 06:40.040
Hey, you, get this off of me!

06:40.630 --> 06:44.000
That cannot be removed with
just a little brute force.

06:44.000 --> 06:47.230
Now, soldier of the royalty,

06:47.240 --> 06:49.220
you'll be coming with me.

06:57.380 --> 06:59.020
Hiro!

07:03.850 --> 07:10.060
If the princess wants her soldier back,
she should come to my castle!

07:12.960 --> 07:15.940
Well then, Reiri, take your time.

07:17.900 --> 07:20.510
So, what are you here for tonight?

07:21.140 --> 07:25.770
I overheard something interesting tonight.

07:25.770 --> 07:27.740
Something interesting?

07:27.740 --> 07:31.810
Princess, do you know a vampire
named Duke Dracul?

07:31.810 --> 07:34.880
Duke Dracul? I've heard of him.

07:34.880 --> 07:37.750
I recall that he was quite old.

07:37.750 --> 07:43.030
Someone in the Royal Family has made
contact with him recently, it seems.

07:45.060 --> 07:47.540
Let's hope nothing comes of it.

07:48.730 --> 07:50.710
Why are you telling me this?

07:51.100 --> 07:53.470
Relations amongst vampires are strong.

07:53.470 --> 07:57.370
You don't speak of your internal problems
to other races normally.

07:57.370 --> 08:01.610
Oh, but Princess, are we not friends?

08:01.610 --> 08:07.620
You don't find it fun to see my blood
stolen by another vampire, do you?

08:08.220 --> 08:10.020
That's a good question.

08:10.020 --> 08:13.190
In any case, watch out for Duke Dracul.

08:14.620 --> 08:16.790
Take me to him!

08:16.790 --> 08:21.900
Take me to wherever that rotten vampire is!

08:22.560 --> 08:23.630
Liza...

08:23.630 --> 08:26.910
Oh my, looks like I was too late after all.

08:37.580 --> 08:40.080
You damn soldier of the Flame...

08:40.850 --> 08:45.720
You became half-immortal thanks to
the power of the Royal Family.

08:45.720 --> 08:48.030
Oh, how I despise you!

08:50.690 --> 08:54.260
What a great yell.
You should be grateful.

08:54.260 --> 08:59.030
I'm teaching you what it feels
like to be an immortal.

08:59.030 --> 09:02.570
The value of being unable to die,
even if you want to.

09:02.570 --> 09:09.280
Do you know what it's like to have your master
hold the reins to your life?

09:09.810 --> 09:13.450
For soldiers of the Flame,
even if they're decapitated,

09:13.450 --> 09:16.790
if you reattach the head right away,
they'll be brought back to life.

09:17.450 --> 09:20.160
Now, don't you want to test that out?

09:26.630 --> 09:28.030
Huga.

09:28.030 --> 09:29.900
Ow-ow...

09:29.900 --> 09:33.270
So, you're saying Duke Dracul kidnapped Hiro?

09:33.270 --> 09:37.170
That jerk! I won't let him get away with this!

09:37.170 --> 09:38.170
Huga.

09:38.170 --> 09:41.180
It's a trap to lure you out, Princess.

09:41.180 --> 09:42.440
It's probably one of the five head siblings...

09:43.980 --> 09:45.610
That's enough.

09:45.610 --> 09:49.220
In any case, if we don't rescue
him within two to three days,

09:49.220 --> 09:51.190
the Flame of Life within him
will be exhausted and he will die.

09:54.520 --> 09:56.920
That's terrible for Hiro.

09:56.930 --> 10:00.960
Princess, you shouldn't leave the
mansion for a few days.

10:00.960 --> 10:04.770
What?! Are you ready to give up on Hiro?

10:05.830 --> 10:09.370
Excuse me, would you mind not touching me
with your filthy paws?

10:11.140 --> 10:13.850
What?! What are you...

10:14.080 --> 10:15.580
Take me.

10:15.580 --> 10:16.880
Huh?

10:16.880 --> 10:19.880
Take me to Duke Dracul's lair.

10:19.880 --> 10:21.860
I'm going to rescue Hiro.

10:22.420 --> 10:27.090
Princess, can you say something to your dog?

10:27.090 --> 10:29.470
Reiri, I'm asking you too.

10:30.830 --> 10:32.460
Princess...

10:33.700 --> 10:36.300
I'm positive it's a trap.

10:36.830 --> 10:38.970
Only until we enter it.

10:40.600 --> 10:44.640
I cannot refuse if you are asking
me to do it, Princess.

10:44.640 --> 10:49.010
Very well, I shall take you to Duke Dracul's castle.

10:49.010 --> 10:51.750
Princess, you owe me one.

10:53.410 --> 10:55.880
I'll pay you back someday with interest.

10:55.880 --> 10:57.760
I cannot wait.

10:59.120 --> 11:02.960
I'll take you there, but can you get these
obtrusive handcuffs off of me?

11:02.960 --> 11:03.960
Not gonna happen.

11:03.960 --> 11:04.590
Huga.

11:06.900 --> 11:08.860
Do you not trust me?

11:08.860 --> 11:11.030
Whatever you say,
I can't take them off of you.

11:11.030 --> 11:12.670
Why not?

11:12.670 --> 11:14.840
Because I don't have the key.

11:15.770 --> 11:20.310
My goodness, why must I travel with this beast?

11:20.810 --> 11:23.510
Hey! Can't you fly any faster?

11:23.510 --> 11:25.990
What a fussy bitch.

11:28.250 --> 11:31.850
Well, Flandre, let's get going.

11:31.850 --> 11:32.520
Huga?

11:33.860 --> 11:37.090
We will be jumping right into the enemy's hands.

11:37.090 --> 11:39.400
We have to prepare accordingly.

11:39.890 --> 11:41.530
Don't you agree?

11:41.530 --> 11:43.570
All right, here we go.

12:05.590 --> 12:10.590
Wow, a vampire town on the border
of the Royal Kingdom.

12:11.130 --> 12:13.430
It's closer than I thought it'd be.

12:13.430 --> 12:17.500
The Kingdom and the other world are not
separated by physical distance, but...

12:17.500 --> 12:18.970
Shut up!

12:18.970 --> 12:21.600
Could you not stand so close to me?

12:21.600 --> 12:25.840
I can't get away from you because of the
handcuffs, so we're stuck together!

12:25.840 --> 12:27.880
And whose fault is that?

12:28.340 --> 12:30.280
Well, whatever.

12:30.280 --> 12:35.490
Anyway, Duke Dracul's castle is surrounded
by a village of lower-class vampires.

12:36.120 --> 12:41.570
If a werewolf like you, their sworn enemy,
were to be found, they'd lynch you immediately.

12:42.520 --> 12:46.800
They are incredibly sensitive to
the scent of werewolves.

12:48.430 --> 12:51.670
With that said, here I go!

12:51.670 --> 12:53.650
What's the big idea?!

12:55.300 --> 12:57.870
Ow-ow...

12:59.610 --> 13:02.940
Just how stupid of a bitch are you?

13:02.940 --> 13:04.240
What did you say?!

13:04.250 --> 13:07.310
Unless you are bitten by me
and turned into a vampire,

13:07.320 --> 13:10.620
you'll never be able to pass through here.

13:10.620 --> 13:15.320
It will be impossible for you to even
make it to Duke Dracul's castle.

13:15.320 --> 13:17.320
Wh..Whatever!

13:17.330 --> 13:21.230
I'd rather die here than be bitten
by a damn vampire!

13:21.230 --> 13:23.160
You are but a beast, huh?

13:23.160 --> 13:26.610
Padding your ego while forgetting
your objective, are we?

13:32.340 --> 13:33.670
Fine.

13:33.680 --> 13:35.080
Really?

13:35.080 --> 13:36.890
Go nuts.

13:37.210 --> 13:39.050
All right, then.

13:39.050 --> 13:43.020
By the way, I have something I'd like to add.

13:43.020 --> 13:44.380
What?

13:44.390 --> 13:47.200
Sucking a dog's blood is the worst.

13:53.260 --> 13:54.360
Now then,

13:54.360 --> 13:55.460
sin

13:55.460 --> 13:56.600
Like hell!

13:56.600 --> 13:58.980
If you're done, then let's get going!

13:59.830 --> 14:02.970
Have the princess turn you back to normal later.

14:05.010 --> 14:07.320
No sleep for you yet.

14:07.880 --> 14:12.520
The Flame of Life hasn't burned out yet.

14:15.120 --> 14:17.450
But it is truly a wonderful thing.

14:17.450 --> 14:20.370
You will not die, even undergoing all this torture.

14:21.290 --> 14:23.570
But soon...

14:23.790 --> 14:28.790
Soon I, too, will be able to enjoy
having eternal life, just like you.

14:29.400 --> 14:32.400
This decrepit old body will be restored.

14:33.600 --> 14:35.400
Soon?

14:35.400 --> 14:37.900
Your master...

14:37.910 --> 14:41.250
The princess is on her way to save you.

14:42.380 --> 14:43.510
Hime will...

14:43.510 --> 14:48.760
Yes, the softhearted princess
who can't even desert a servant

14:49.650 --> 14:51.890
He told me so.

14:51.890 --> 14:53.520
He?

14:53.520 --> 14:56.790
Isn't it obvious?
The princess's brother.

14:56.790 --> 14:58.730
Emile?

14:58.730 --> 15:02.560
Siblings fighting for the throne...
What a repugnant scene.

15:02.560 --> 15:06.630
I will drink the princess's blood
and her brother loses an enemy.

15:06.630 --> 15:08.940
Two birds with one stone.

15:13.780 --> 15:17.910
There are some basic rules even in a fight
amongst Royal Family members.

15:17.910 --> 15:19.310
Hug;-a?

15:19.310 --> 15:22.520
One will not use an army.

15:22.520 --> 15:27.470
Am I attempting to break that rule? Or...

15:38.370 --> 15:40.000
Hide.

15:43.870 --> 15:47.940
You'd have been spotted right away
if you hadn't turned into a vampire.

15:52.880 --> 15:54.920
Is this Duke Dracul's castle?

15:54.920 --> 15:57.990
Hiro is being held somewhere inside.

15:58.990 --> 16:01.730
Wh..Where should we sneak in?

16:03.060 --> 16:04.870
I think...

16:08.300 --> 16:10.400
Looks like we can get inside through there.

16:10.400 --> 16:12.040
Yeah...

16:14.770 --> 16:16.540
Th..That...

16:17.000 --> 16:20.340
My, looks like there's a guard here.

16:20.340 --> 16:22.150
A Qllard?

16:25.150 --> 16:28.420
Oh, looks like she's arrived.

16:28.420 --> 16:30.520
We shall go greet her.

16:31.450 --> 16:34.250
Shall the games begin now?

16:34.260 --> 16:39.260
I will soon... soon become the supreme vampire!

16:39.730 --> 16:42.400
Once I drink the princess's blood,

16:42.400 --> 16:45.000
I needn't fear even Death itself.

16:45.770 --> 16:47.400
Hime...

16:50.440 --> 16:53.670
What? Only you two?

16:53.670 --> 16:57.740
Where's the princess?

16:57.750 --> 16:59.410
Damn you!

16:59.410 --> 17:01.450
My name is Liza Wildman.

17:01.450 --> 17:03.880
You got me good back there.

17:03.890 --> 17:07.150
I swear upon the name of the great warrior,
Worg Wildman,

17:07.150 --> 17:08.960
I will defeat you!

17:09.960 --> 17:12.830
I have no business with a dog!

17:12.830 --> 17:14.590
Hiro!

17:14.600 --> 17:19.600
Looks like you were abandoned
by your master, useless cur.

17:20.970 --> 17:22.470
Hime...

17:22.470 --> 17:24.380
Kill them!

17:27.210 --> 17:29.910
Damn it! Do something!

17:29.910 --> 17:32.720
Do something?
There's nothing I can do.

17:38.750 --> 17:40.220
What do you think you're doing?!

17:40.220 --> 17:43.000
I was just trying to dodge his attack.

17:48.260 --> 17:50.110
Fly! Now!

17:52.770 --> 17:56.170
A savage like you should fight a fellow savage!

17:56.170 --> 17:59.040
Where's your usual animal power?

17:59.040 --> 18:02.210
Shut up! I can't fight like this!

18:07.110 --> 18:09.620
Hurry and do something!

18:09.620 --> 18:10.950
Do something?

18:10.950 --> 18:13.190
We aren't even fighting.

18:13.190 --> 18:15.190
Are we just being fooled around with?

18:15.190 --> 18:17.860
Wait! We aren't even fighting?

18:17.860 --> 18:20.490
Is that your werewolves' warrior pride again?

18:20.490 --> 18:23.100
No, we don't have to fight.

18:23.100 --> 18:24.330
What?

18:24.330 --> 18:26.640
Just do as I say.

18:26.830 --> 18:31.270
Take orders from a dog? It would hurt my pride

18:31.270 --> 18:34.940
This isn't the time for that! Just listen!

18:34.940 --> 18:37.480
Could you not stand so close to me?

18:37.480 --> 18:39.950
I don't know what you're discussing,

18:39.950 --> 18:42.950
but you won't defeat him that easily.

18:43.480 --> 18:46.190
Will something so simple actually work?

18:48.120 --> 18:50.500
It will work because it's so simple!

18:55.560 --> 18:57.870
Over here, big boy!

19:10.440 --> 19:12.010
Now!

19:12.010 --> 19:14.490
Could you not order me around?

19:15.480 --> 19:17.460
Take that!

19:22.820 --> 19:24.460
Fall!

19:25.490 --> 19:30.100
My, my, even a dog's words
come in handy sometimes.

19:30.100 --> 19:33.200
Is that all you can say?!

19:33.200 --> 19:35.340
Forget that, what about Hiro?

19:35.340 --> 19:37.080
Oh, right! Hiro!

19:38.640 --> 19:40.970
Oh, you poor thing.

19:40.980 --> 19:43.790
Reiri... Liza...

19:46.610 --> 19:48.920
You really did it now!

19:48.920 --> 19:50.820
You got what you deserved!

19:50.820 --> 19:52.920
You're next, so come on down!

19:52.920 --> 19:55.060
Don't think you're leaving here alive.

19:55.060 --> 19:56.820
Excellent, just try me!

19:56.820 --> 20:00.460
What are you thinking?
We should be running away.

20:00.460 --> 20:02.740
Too late!

20:08.100 --> 20:10.670
A swarm of lower-class vampires...

20:11.840 --> 20:12.910
Get them!

20:12.910 --> 20:14.210
Very well.

20:14.210 --> 20:16.340
I will be your opponent.

20:16.340 --> 20:17.980
Hime...

20:18.510 --> 20:21.110
So, you've finally shown yourself, Hime?

20:21.120 --> 20:23.280
I've been waiting for this moment.

20:23.280 --> 20:26.350
Princess, give me eternal life!

20:26.350 --> 20:29.860
However, it's all-out war.

20:30.520 --> 20:33.530
Liza! I've missed you!

20:33.530 --> 20:39.000
Princess, are you sure we will be of use?

20:39.230 --> 20:44.010
What's this, Princess?
Is it not against the rules to use an army?

20:44.870 --> 20:46.970
Don't get the wrong idea.

20:46.970 --> 20:51.970
I'm here to punish all those involved in the
kidnapping of the soldier of my Flame of Life.

20:52.850 --> 20:57.460
Or are you saying you're a servant of
a member of the Royal Family?

20:58.250 --> 21:02.060
Very well, I will withdraw for today.

21:02.060 --> 21:06.100
But don't think I've given up yet!

21:08.100 --> 21:10.000
You there, vampire,

21:10.000 --> 21:14.700
I'll have you banished from the
vampire realm for betraying your own kind!

21:14.700 --> 21:17.440
Prepare yourself!

21:19.240 --> 21:20.570
Hey, Reiri.

21:20.570 --> 21:22.950
Wh..What is it, Liza?

21:25.550 --> 21:27.910
Because you were so useless,

21:27.920 --> 21:30.420
we had it really tough this time!

21:31.620 --> 21:34.490
Just how disrespectful of a bitch are you?!

21:34.490 --> 21:36.970
To think you've forgotten that
it was I who got us here!

21:37.160 --> 21:38.090
Huga.

21:38.090 --> 21:40.160
You don't have to break down
everything they're saying, Flandre.

21:42.130 --> 21:42.260
Huga.

21:43.260 --> 21:43.660
We're going to settle this one day!

21:46.170 --> 21:49.440
My goodness, I had to suck
your disgusting blood,

21:49.440 --> 21:51.910
though at least it was a virgin's blood.

21:51.910 --> 21:53.270
Y..You could tell?!

21:53.270 --> 21:55.120
What? Really?

21:55.640 --> 21:58.110
What?! You tricked me!

21:58.110 --> 21:58.750
You're blushing!

22:00.310 --> 22:00.450
Leave me alone!

22:05.320 --> 22:09.200
If I were just a bit younger, I'd...

23:41.580 --> 23:42.650
Huga.

23:42.650 --> 23:45.050
Reiri came to save me.

23:45.050 --> 23:46.050
Huga.

23:46.050 --> 23:48.590
So, I want to save her!

23:48.590 --> 23:49.590
Huga.

23:49.590 --> 23:51.660
Next episode, "Princess Banishment"

23:51.660 --> 23:52.490
Reiri's in trouble!

23:53.490 --> 23:55.900
Reiri, I'm coming to rescue you!

23:55.900 --> 23:58.730
If that's true, can you not stay behind
everyone, shaking in fear,

23:58.730 --> 24:01.400
and instead, fight on the front line, Hiro?

24:01.400 --> 24:04.540
Ah! Can you not push me, Hime?

24:04.540 --> 24:07.780
It's dangerous being thrown into
the middle of a fight! Hime!

24:07.880 --> 24:09.040
Idiot.

24:09.040 --> 24:10.750
Huga, huga.
